      "lines": [
        "例3 已知$x\\approx6.3\\times10^3$，$y\\approx3.26\\times10^5$，求$x$与$y$的和."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们先把和$x+y$变形，把$10^5$（即$10$的带有最大指数的",
        "幂）提出到括号外.得："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x+y\\approx6.3\\times10^3+3.26\\times10^5=10^5(6.3\\cdot10^{-2}+3.26)↵=10^5(0.063+3.26)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在$0.063$与$3.26$相加时，应用上述法则，得："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$0.063+3.26=3.323\\approx3.32$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，$x+y\\approx3.32\\times10^5$."
      ]
    },
    {
